  body={[
    "We serve Palmetto and the surrounding Manatee County area with commercial concrete flatwork, slabs, curb and gutter, and interior concrete scopes. Our crews are experienced in coordinating with civil, structural, and MEP trades to keep the project sequenced correctly.",
    "Gulfway is a licensed general contractor — we manage concrete as a standalone trade or as part of a complete construction scope. One phone call, full project control."
  ]}
  bullets={[
    "Concrete slabs on grade & flatwork",
    "Curb, gutter & sidewalk construction",
    "Interior concrete for buildouts & renovations",
    "Saw cutting & core drilling",
    "Vapor barrier & reinforcement installation",
    "Coordination with structural & civil drawings"
  ]}
  heroImage="/images/service-renovation.jpg"
  heroAlt="Commercial concrete work in Palmetto FL"
/>
